.TH "DNSGRAM" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "" "PowerDNS Authoritative Server"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnsgram \- A debugging tool for intermittent resolver failures
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBdnsgram\fP \fIINFILE\fP\&...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBdnsgram\fP takes one or more \fIINFILE\fPs in PCAP format and generates
statistics on 5 second segments allowing the study of intermittent
resolver issues.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
None
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
pcap(3PCAP), tcpdump(8)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
PowerDNS.COM BV
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
PowerDNS.COM BV
